        "path": "publicObservation.publicLabel",
        "reason": "recomputable",
        "rationale": "VERDICT_PUBLIC_LABEL[verdict] — measured identical on all 19 served sidecars, 0 mismatches. The verdict token stays bound, so the label adds no semantics and only adds copy fragility."
