        "path": "agentGuidance.goal",
        "reason": "constant",
        "rationale": "One distinct value across all 19 served sidecars. A constant carries no per-subject information; the protocol steps/mustAsk/mustStop/prohibitedShortcuts that DO carry semantics all remain bound."
      }
